<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read Tolvira's privacy approach, including local processing, hosting logs, external links and future analytics choices.">
  <header class="page-head"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated October 13, 2026</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lede">This policy describes the current Tolvira hub. Independent tools may provide additional notices based on how they process data.</p></div></header>
  <article class="section narrow prose"><h2>Data we collect</h2><p>The hub has no accounts, contact form backend or analytics scripts. We do not intentionally collect names, email addresses or files through this website.</p><h2>Hosting data</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process technical request data such as IP addresses, browser details and timestamps to deliver and protect the site. That processing is governed by the provider's terms and privacy notices.</p><h2>Tool processing</h2><p>Each independent tool must explain whether processing occurs locally or uses a remote service. Do not assume every future tool processes data locally; read the notice shown by the tool you use.</p><h2>Local storage</h2><p>The hub stores your color-theme preference in your browser. This value stays on your device and does not identify you to Tolvira.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Links to sponsors, repositories, payment providers or other services lead to third parties with their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Future analytics</h2><p>Privacy-conscious analytics may be added after review. This policy and any consent controls will be updated before tracking that requires them is enabled.</p><h2>Contact and legal review</h2><p>A verified public contact channel will be added before launch. This policy requires legal review for the jurisdictions in which Tolvira operates.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
